= The Duchess of Mandalore

The warrior world of **Mandalore** has a new ruler: Duchess **Satine Kryze**, leader of the pacifist New Mandalorians. She has begun gathering neutral systems into a loose association that refuses to take sides in the Republic's quarrels.

- @welcome: Welcome her and build ties with the neutral systems.
- @ignore: Mandalore is not our concern.

@welcome
subtitle: The Independents approve; a future mediator.
on-arrival: ind_relation += 6; satine_friend = 1; pacifist_dissent -= 3

Satine and Mon Mothma become friends, as far as two such reserved women can.

@ignore

Mandalore goes its own way.
